{"id": "112-2-E-001", "year": 112, "session": 2, "subject": "E", "number": 1, "stem": "核電站意外事故時，公眾有可能攝入含有放射性的物質， FDA 核定的放射性核種清除劑（ radionuclide\neliminators ），下列何者錯誤？", "options": {"A": "碘化鉀片", "B": "顆粒細胞集落刺激因子（ G-CSF ）", "C": "普魯士藍膠囊", "D": "二亞乙基三胺（ DTPA ）"}, "answer": "B", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": false, "figures": [], "source": "sources/112_2/55_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
{"id": "112-2-E-002", "year": 112, "session": 2, "subject": "E", "number": 2, "stem": "哺乳動物的端粒由一長串重複序列 TTAGGG 所構成，每次一個正常的體細胞分裂，端粒的末端就會部分喪失；\n端粒酶（ telomerase ）是一種反轉錄酶，其活化會造成下列何種現象？", "options": {"A": "端粒（ telomere ）的縮短", "B": "細胞進入臨界（ crisis ）狀態", "C": "細胞的永生化（ immortalized ）", "D": "細胞的衰老（ senescence ）"}, "answer": "C", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": false, "figures": [], "source": "sources/112_2/55_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
{"id": "112-2-E-003", "year": 112, "session": 2, "subject": "E", "number": 3, "stem": "欲使 CHO 細胞存活率從 1 降至 0.37 ，在含氧狀態下所需的劑量為 2 Gy ，在缺氧狀態下所需的劑量為 4 Gy ，而\n在含氧及 150 mg cysteamine 存在下所需的劑量為 6 Gy ，則其劑量降低因子（ dose-reduction factor, DRF ）為若\n干？", "options": {"A": "0.5", "B": "1.5", "C": "2.0", "D": "3.0"}, "answer": "D", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": false, "figures": [], "source": "sources/112_2/55_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
