{"id": "112-2-E-005", "year": 112, "session": 2, "subject": "E", "number": 5, "stem": "依據過去治療資料顯示，罹患肺結核患者進行人工氣胸（ artificial pneumothorax ）時會經歷多次 X 光透視，此\n輻射曝露會提高下列何種癌症的發生率？", "options": {"A": "肺癌", "B": "甲狀腺癌", "C": "乳癌", "D": "皮膚癌"}, "answer": "C", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": false, "figures": [], "source": "sources/112_2/55_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
{"id": "112-2-E-006", "year": 112, "session": 2, "subject": "E", "number": 6, "stem": "經 M 期同期化後的哺乳動物細胞，在不同時間點照射約 6 Gy 的 X 光，可得下圖，其可能是何種細胞，原因為\n何？", "options": {"A": "人類 HeLa 細胞，因為 S 期輻射抗性高", "B": "中國倉鼠細胞，因為 M 期長", "C": "人類 HeLa 細胞，因為 M 期輻射抗性低", "D": "中國倉鼠細胞，因為 G1 期短"}, "answer": "D", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": true, "figures": [], "source": "sources/112_2/55_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
